n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I should not be charge=
d to obtain information that:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">1. You initially claim=
