</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">3. Documents law enfor=
cement officers who visited my home on restricted federal land<o:p></o:p></=
span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">4. Will be published f=
