</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">If you deny this fee w=
aiver request, I will fully appeal through all available administrative and=
 legal channels. I am documenting every stage of this process, and denial o=
f a fee waiver under these circumstances
 will itself become part of the public record.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am watching the cloc=
k. Please process this request expeditiously.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">---<o:p></o:p></span><=
/p>
