<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Conclusion<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I meet the statutory c=
riteria for indigence. This record serves a clear public interest and will =
be made publicly available. Charging me $12.50 under these circumstances is=
 neither legally required nor appropriate.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I respectfully request=
 immediate waiver of the fee and production of the responsive CAD record.<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
