<b>To:</b> Carlson, Marni L &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:Marni.Carlson@osp.oregon.=
gov">Marni.Carlson@osp.oregon.gov</a>&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Re: SP26097765 - PR27478 - White</span> <o:p></o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Dear Public Records Of=
ficer:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am writing to reques=
t a waiver of the $12.50 fee associated with producing the Computer-Aided D=
ispatch (CAD) record you have identified as responsive to my public records=
 request.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I request this fee wai=
ver on the following grounds:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">1. Public Interest in =
Disclosure<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">This record documents =
law enforcement contact that occurred on restricted federal land behind a l=
ocked gate where I live and work as a volunteer caretaker for the U.S. Fore=
st Service. On March 24, 2026&#8212;exactly
 one year after my dismissal from the Oregon State Parks volunteer program&=
#8212;three armed officers appeared at my residence: one U.S. Forest Servic=
e special agent and two Oregon State Police officers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I was not provided the=
 names or badge numbers of the state police officers at the time of contact=
. When I asked the USFS special agent's supervisor (Captain Brandon Boyd) t=
o identify the two state officers, he
 instructed me to file this FOIA request to obtain that information.<o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">The public has a signi=
ficant interest in understanding:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">- Under what authority=
 state police officers accessed restricted federal land<o:p></o:p></span></=
p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">- What coordination oc=
curred between state and federal agencies<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">- Whether this contact=
 was connected to my prior documentation of institutional conduct at Oregon=
 State Parks<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">- Whether proper proto=
cols were followed for multi-agency law enforcement contact with a civilian=
 on federal property<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">2. I Am Not Seeking Co=
mmercial Gain<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am seeking this info=
rmation solely to understand the circumstances of law enforcement contact a=
t my residence and to exercise my right to know the identities of officers =
who appeared at my door. I have no commercial
 interest in this record.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">3. Ability to Pay<o:p>=
</o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am a volunteer caret=
aker living in an RV with no regular income. The $12.50 fee, while modest, =
represents a meaningful expense given my current financial constraints. Mor=
e importantly, charging a fee to learn
 the identity of officers who visited my home creates a barrier to a fundam=
ental right.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">4. I Have Every Right =
to Know Who Visited Me<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">When law enforcement o=
fficers appear at a person's residence&#8212;particularly on restricted fed=
eral land where public access is prohibited&#8212;that person has a basic r=
ight to know who those officers are. Requiring payment
 to obtain this information creates an unjust barrier to accountability.<o:=
p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">The CAD record you hav=
e identified contains information I should have been provided at the time o=
f contact. I should not be required to pay for information that should have=
 been disclosed voluntarily.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Conclusion<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">For the reasons stated=
 above, I respectfully request that you waive the $12.50 fee and provide th=
e responsive CAD record at no cost.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">If you deny this fee w=
aiver request, please provide a written explanation of the denial and infor=
m me of any appeal rights.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Thank you for your con=
sideration.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Robert Samuel White&nb=
sp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
